  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The title pretty much says it all, but it is something that would really make alot of people happy.\n\nHaving to open up the Main Menu over and over again is pretty tedious since the setting is not saved after sessions. \n\nSo having it in the quick menu instead would at least be the logical thing to do since it's a setting that most people would frequently change (at least I do).\n\nIt would be very much appreciated if the option was put into the quick menu during this beta :)",
